      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/274mariselvi\">@274mariselvi</a></p>\n<p>By Default, Patient is customer But Insurance (Star Health) can be handled same time with customer if you start using Customer Group as Accounting Dimension.</p>\n<p>By this way , customer will always be booked with Customer Group in Accounting Ledgers and incase of One Insurance covering multiple patient / customers, you will have luxury of maintaining individual ledger for patient as well group ledger for Insurance as well.</p>",
